  SELECT * FROM time_series.cagg_bucket_function
  WHERE cagg_id = (SELECT cagg_id FROM time_series.continuous_agg WHERE user_view_name = 'cv');
NOTICE:  Table doesn't have 'DISTRIBUTED BY' clause -- Using column(s) named 'cagg_id' as the Apache Cloudberry data distribution key for this table.
