=== REFRESH-FORCE-C: force=FALSE on already-up-to-date is a NOTICE no-op ===
CALL time_series.refresh_continuous_aggregate('force_cv', NULL, NULL);
NOTICE:  refreshing continuous aggregate "force_cv"
NOTICE:  continuous aggregate "force_cv" is already up-to-date
